    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28194" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δουλ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>enslave,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δουλοῖς καὶ σὲ καὶ πᾶσαν πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					254
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				467
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. φρόνημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.61
				</span></i>
			:—mostly in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be enslaved,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ Πέρσῃσι, ὑπὸ Ἁρπάγου,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.94
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				174
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.98
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ψ&lt;&gt;χαὶ
				δεδούλωνται</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				23
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδουλωμένοι τῇ γνώμῃ, τὴν
				γνώμην ἐδουλοῦντο,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.71
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλεύθερος πᾶς ἑνὶ δεδούλωται, νόμῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					699
				</span></i>
			, cf <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sam.</u>
				280
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			 (with pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδουλῶσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.82
				</span></i>
			), <i>make subject to oneself, enslave,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.68
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Mx.</u>
				239d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἥσσονα δουλούμεθ᾽ ἄνδρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					493
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθυμίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					838d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἑαυτοῦ θειότατον ὑπὸ τῷ
					ἀθεωτάτῳ . . δουλοῦται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					589e
				</span></i>
			.</div>
